// The fixture embedder module of internal/kavungen's TestEmbedder: a module of its own (so the repository's ./...
// never builds it) that extends Kavun the way an embedder does, generated by kavun-gen and rendered by kavun-docs.
// The test runs it in a temporary workspace with the repository, whose go.mod and go.sum give Kavun's dependencies.
module example.com/kavunembed

go 1.27

require github.com/jokruger/kavun v0.0.0-00010101000000-000000000000

replace github.com/jokruger/kavun => ../../../..
